  "controls": [
    "native debug timers preserve original callable shapes and defer category or timestamp observation",
    "native debug timers format original thresholds rounding signed zero and nonfinite values",
    "native debug timers preserve repeated original numeric coercion and Number receiver brands",
    "native debug timers use captured Number Math and string methods after guest replacement",
    "native debug timers perform split object destructuring index zero before index one",
    "native debug timers escape trace labels and emit begin before the timestamp",
    "native debug timers coerce labels before has and capture set before live hrtime",
    "native debug timers default log label applies only to undefined and Symbols stop before has",
    "native debug timers duplicate warning returns before flag coercion trace and clock",
    "native debug timers direct time always stores while only the trace bit controls begin",
    "native debug timers missing end label warns then emits end and deletes",
    "native debug timers elapsed arithmetic reads and coerces seconds before nanoseconds",
    "native debug timers timeLog preserves optional argument arity and keeps the stored timestamp",
    "native debug timers end flag combinations retain the original delete and logging order",
    "native debug timers a logger throw prevents end trace and deletion and preserves identity",
    "native debug timers a trace throw occurs before start timestamp and after end logging",
    "native debug timers retain live two-step replaceAll and forward its result without extra coercion",
    "native debug timers retain the selected set method across hrtime reentry",
    "native debug timers start trace reentry happens before either timestamp is stored",
    "native debug timers uppercase the category once at construction with captured string methods",
    "native debug timers leave testEnabled uninitialized until explicit initialization and then retry",
    "native debug timers invoke the init callback unconditionally even when both paths are disabled",
    "native debug timers skip timestamps labels and output only for the original both-disabled condition",
    "native debug timers trace an enabled category without reading pid stderr or logging",
    "native debug timers log through actual colors inspector and format with tracing disabled",
    "native debug timers read the real shared enabled byte on every escaped internal call",
    "native debug timers share one SafeMap per uppercase set across independent factories",
    "native debug timers recheck the enabled byte after init callback changes it",
    "native debug timers retain initialized cells after a callback throw and retry the original callback",
    "native debug timers run init for every original arrow while escaped internals reuse captures",
    "native debug timers share original initializeDebugEnv state without retroactively changing escaped flags",
    "native debug timers emit the original HTTP warning on each init before category observation",
    "native debug timers observe current pid then two live stderr reads with write captured before format",
    "native debug timers forward ordinary colors options to the actual inspector",
    "native debug timers spread extra values through SafeArrayIterator without reading a guest iterator",
    "native debug timers keep formatter arguments ordered after selecting the second write method",
    "native debug timers capture trace binding named imports once in original order",
    "native debug timers require the exact ordinary owner and reject foreign trace identity on reacquisition",
    "native debug timers require actual prior SafeMap bootstrap and never supply a missing trace binding",
    "native debug timers preserve reentrant complete owner publication during trace import capture",
    "native debug timers propagate native fatal trace before timestamp storage in literal and native bodies",
    "native debug timers retire an ignored trace return before timestamp storage",
    "native debug timers retire missing-label warning returns before trace and delete",
    "native debug timers retire init callback results before entering the original arrow body",
    "native debug timers retain source pid local through write and retire it on function exit",
    "native debug timers box a primitive split result once before both object pattern Gets",
    "native debug timers reject nullish split results at the original object pattern conversion"
  ],
